Package: com.fluoxetine.luros.dev.tweak
Name: Luros Tweak Development
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Description: Tweak templates and hooking headers for Luros, for @FLAVOR@ jailbreaks
 Lets Luros create, build and package Objective-C tweaks on the device: a
 template that hooks SpringBoard through the substrate-compatible API, the
 headers and link stubs for that API, and the process filter. Needs an
 injection framework, which your preferred package manager installs with it.
